ります","ts":"1633306934.428000","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","reply_count":13,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eOkI"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"38cd5df1-f4bf-4c45-a8d8-63c96ab6ca33","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"昨日2回目接種でけっこうつらい状態です\nいま測ったら37.8℃だった","ts":"1633307467.429100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"odaijini","count":2,"users":["U0238G3KV8D","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8IJ2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3df1c6a1-6290-40e8-8205-1bdd9faec093","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ワクチン打ってなかった人は本格的に打てなくなります","ts":"1633306934.428000","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","reply_count":13,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eOkI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"def901db-b7f0-4349-9e56-d649de2f1aab","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"10月で一回目接種が締め切られるそうです","ts":"1633306907.427300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pERm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cdef782b-4288-4858-bb85-b16c770136ce","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":":wakuchin: :wakuchin2: :vaccine: 気づけば増えてるのでブースター接種の準備も万端ですね","ts":"1633304713.425200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cmSW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9532abf-7c2f-4298-8c09-22e6c408c106","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"本日ワクチン二回目接種してきます","ts":"1633300708.423300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vaccine","count":6,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U76GA7MFA","U81LLJ340","U022XK5866Q","U06BRP8VD","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"57f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdb553e2-9617-4157-9d2d-a91a1335aa4f","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"タンニンがある飲み物といえば赤ワインですね、とくにNebbioloとDelcettoあたり。","ts":"1633281117.422800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"thinking_face","count":1,"users":["UQX22KG9F"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l9p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"838833b6-96bd-4e1b-8f54-641469ef3033","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"む、とするとコーヒーとタンニン分のあるなにかを一緒に飲むと、カフェインよわくできそう","ts":"1633281064.422100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aqA57"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcb48156-501e-439d-8879-529fd1d30c89","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"個別接種はワクチン不足で混乱したせいでほとんどのところで止めてしまってるんですよ","ts":"1633307741.429500","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VGOW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f59599a3-8fed-4d7b-9279-dd1c42616054","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"再開してくれるとよいのですけどね","ts":"1633307753.429700","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hcpec"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8d1172f-be8f-4582-831f-8599860bd4c7","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そちらで受けられるのかな","ts":"1633307873.430600","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ryu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78b335ae-5076-47d7-9e10-defb28ce45d5","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"接種予約しにくくなったから接種しないという人がでなければよいのですが","ts":"1633307896.430800","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jJk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff8543c2-b43e-4845-8dd1-4da071adca21","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ここ数週間は予約取りやすかったのに取らなかったということなので、予約のしにくさを理由に受けないっていうのは、あたらないでしょう。本質的に別の理由があることになる。\n\n自治体としては予約が入らなくなってるから集団接種はやめようとなってるわけで。あとは接種率が目標に達したからとかね。","ts":"1633308367.431200","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dbA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c314144-d765-4926-ae39-e2f8256bcd24","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"どこかに一本化すればまだ接種会場は確保できる気もする","ts":"1633309019.431600","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w2sWF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aed8d475-b520-450c-8066-8c5e1ff67b4f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"それこそ、予約のいらない接種会場は活躍するのかもしれない","ts":"1633309036.431800","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j1pT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"725017cd-25ba-4f14-9e4f-195d57fee374","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そうなると「移動の負担が～」って言い出しますよ。すでに東京と大阪のはあったわけだし。","ts":"1633309061.432000","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2aIs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b75a717-27f6-48fd-b995-14c4c6c14296","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"都道府県ごとにもあった。","ts":"1633309072.432200","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1633309089.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FiU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f2e4149-7a63-4eea-9edc-97f835e9e661","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"うーん、困ったものですね","ts":"1633309677.433800","thread_ts":"1633306934.428000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original